{"id":"21edd49e38c96ce7","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa.md","title":"Gentzen's Consistency Proof for PA","display":"thm-gentzen-consistency-pa — Gentzen's Consistency Proof for PA","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa","aliases":["72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa"],"display":"thm-gentzen-consistency-pa — Gentzen's Consistency Proof for PA","depends_on":["[[72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency]]","[[72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate]]","[[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]","[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §2.2.2, print264–266/PDF276–278; Feferman reductive proof theory §3 https://math.stanford.edu/~feferman/papers/reductive.pdf","verification_status":"source-and-argument-reviewed","proof_status":"source-statement-checked; exact PR descent construction not reconstructed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gentzen-consistency-pa — Gentzen's Consistency Proof for PA"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f2af689634edc66\" href=\"?note=4f2af689634edc66\" title=\"72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency\">72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6d0ec6804191d5a4\" href=\"?note=6d0ec6804191d5a4\" title=\"72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate\">72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c3ecb3059f70f57\" href=\"?note=1c3ecb3059f70f57\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic\">72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c14656043bc77c1\" href=\"?note=4c14656043bc77c1\" title=\"72-df-arithmetized-proof\">72-df-arithmetized-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §2.2.2, print264–266/PDF276–278; Feferman reductive proof theory §3 <a href=\"https://math.stanford.edu/~feferman/papers/reductive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://math.stanford.edu/~feferman/papers/reductive.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source-statement-checked; exact PR descent construction not reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>本文件使用算术化接口的数语法模式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota=1\">\\(\\iota=1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_2^{(1)}\">\\(\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\)</span> 检查推导的每一行均为数公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PRA},\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e_\\varepsilon)\">\\(\\mathsf{PRA},\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e_\\varepsilon)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1c3ecb3059f70f57\" href=\"?note=1c3ecb3059f70f57\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic\">72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PA}\">\\(\\mathsf{PA}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_\\varepsilon\">\\(e_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 是上述模式使用的固定程序表示，不按外延相等更换程序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(\\mathsf{PA})\">\\(\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(\\mathsf{PA})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(\\mathsf{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(\\mathsf{PA})\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4c14656043bc77c1\" href=\"?note=4c14656043bc77c1\" title=\"72-df-arithmetized-proof\">72-df-arithmetized-proof</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)\">\\(\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6d0ec6804191d5a4\" href=\"?note=6d0ec6804191d5a4\" title=\"72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate\">72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate</a>，其成员必须有PRA内可证的初始化和严格下降公式。由该证书推出一致性的接口为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4f2af689634edc66\" href=\"?note=4f2af689634edc66\" title=\"72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency\">72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 的量化是元量化。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)\\quad\\mathsf{PRA}\\cup\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e_\\varepsilon)\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(\\mathsf{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)\\quad\\mathsf{PRA}\\cup\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e_\\varepsilon)\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(\\mathsf{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式是Gentzen归约的存在性内容：可选择有限算术证明的证书编码及PR下降程序，使两个局部公式在PRA内可证。第二式对这些编码逐一成立，由内部下降引理和无量词TI得到。由此既保留一致性证明的非空实质，也不把结论错误地扩大到任意仅在标准自然数上同扩张的检查程序。</p>\n<p>源位置沿用原文件的Gentzen分析与Feferman §3；这里补齐的是编码条件和依赖接口，并非机器验证了Gentzen整套归约程序。存在性作为数学定理断言，未以“假定Con可证”替代。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"4f2af689634edc66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate","status":"resolved","id":"6d0ec6804191d5a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-ordinal-descent-certificate]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"1c3ecb3059f70f57","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetized-proof","status":"resolved","id":"4c14656043bc77c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"1c3ecb3059f70f57","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","locat