nal-descent-certificate]]，其成员必须有PRA内可证的初始化和严格下降公式。由该证书推出一致性的接口为 [[72-lem-ordinal-descent-consistency]]。$\\kappa$ 的量化是元量化。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\iota=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_2^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PRA},\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e_\\varepsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"e_\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_{1,E_{\\rm PR}}(\\mathsf{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(\\mathsf{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)\\quad\\mathsf{PRA}\\cup\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e_\\varepsilon)\\vdash_2^{(1)}\\operatorname{Con}_\\kappa(\\mathsf{PA}).","display":true}],"bytes":2593,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa|thm-gentzen-consistency-pa — Gentzen's Consistency Proof for PA]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa|thm-gentzen-consistency-pa — Gentzen's Consistency Proof for PA]]"},{"id":"6df5d33910671b21","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PRA},\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon$ 与 $\\operatorname{GN}_{\\mathsf{PRA}}(\\mathsf{PA},e_\\varepsilon)$ 取 [[72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa]]。$U:=\\mathsf{PRA}\\cup\\operatorname{QF\\!TI}(e_\\varepsilon)$。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-293","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa|72-thm-gentzen-consistency-pa]]"}],"outgoing":["4f2af689634edc66","6d0ec6804191d5a4","1c3ecb3059f70f57","4c14656043bc77c1","5e5fb64772853785"]}